{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人鄭家華於節目中推介嗶哩嗶哩(9626)，指公司近日在低位發行可換股債，隨後幾天成交急增，值得留意。鄭家華建議現價即122.7元買入，目標價158元，止蝕價111元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鄭家華：嗶哩嗶哩(9626)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入　$122.7</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　$158</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　$111</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20269kFTPkSCmX1789371000.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人莫灝楠推介微軟(MSFT)，因美國公布通脹數據後市況未明朗，在科技七雄中尋找與大市敏感度較低的股份候低吸納，同時微軟資本開支增長放緩，亦令市場放心。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026KYm5PGJ68Z1789371130.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">莫灝楠建議現價480美元買入，目標價550美元，止蝕價430美元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260wjR1KgPFo1789371296.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">莫灝楠：微軟(MSFT)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入     480美元</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標　550美元</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕　430美元　</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T08:21:14.618037+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":290,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}